  sentences:
    nameNPC: "L\xFD Kh\xE1nh"
    Lines:
    - "\u0110inh Ho\xE0n \u0111\xEDch th\xE2n c\u1EA7m gi\xE1o, d\u1EABn \u0111\u1EA7u
      to\xE1n qu\xE2n xung phong. H\u1ECD \u0111\u1EA1p n\u01B0\u1EDBc l\u1ED9i qua
      kh\xFAc s\xF4ng n\xF4ng, h\u01B0\u1EDBng th\u1EB3ng v\u1EC1 c\xE1c thuy\u1EC1n
      Tr\u1EA7n \u0111ang \xE1p s\xE1t b\u1EDD."
    - "Ti\u1EBFng h\xF2 h\xE9t vang tr\u1EDDi. Ti\u1EBFng n\u01B0\u1EDBc t\xE9 b\u1EAFn.
      Ti\u1EBFng g\u01B0\u01A1m gi\xE1o va ch\u1EA1m d\u1EEF d\u1ED9i."
